ting\\u003c/concerns\\u003e\\n\\u003cpractices\\u003ego fmt ./... before every commit · go test ./... and go test -race ./... for concurrent code · golangci-lint run · gosec ./... · govulncheck ./... · log with slog, wrap errors with context, and keep tests table-driven with testify\\u003c/practices\\u003e\\n\\u003cadrs\\u003eADR-001 keeps JSONL replay separate from OTel analytics, preserves reported cost when available, uses exact runtime pricing only for known systems/models, and leaves cost unknown otherwise so replay fidelity and cross-tool analytics both survive.\\u003c/adrs\\u003e\\n\\u003cgoverning\\u003eCONTRACT-001 provider metadata and streaming timing — expose provider family/system, resolved model, cache tokens, TTFT, and reported cost/timing only when the SDK actually supplies them; review hx-0b94868b treats this as the next telemetry-chain link after the root package.\\u003c/governing\\u003e\\n\\u003c/context-digest\\u003e\\n\\nFresh-eyes review of last commit ca043d9 (agent-cec3f3ab).\\nReview target: last-commit\",\"id\":\"hx-51f6c7bb\",\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"labels\":[\"helix\",\"kind:planning\",\"action:review\"],\"notes\":\"\\u003cmeasure-results\\u003e\\n  \\u003ctimestamp\\u003e2026-04-10T01:00:08Z\\u003c/timestamp\\u003e\\n  \\u003cstatus\\u003eISSUES_FOUND\\u003c/status\\u003e\\n  \\u003cfindings total='2' filed='2' critical='0' high='0' medium='2' low='0'/\\u003e\\n  \\u003cagents-md-updated\\u003eNO\\u003c/agents-md-updated\\u003e\\n  \\u003clearnings-filed\\u003e0\\u003c/learnings-filed\\u003e\\n  \\u003cevidence\\u003e\\n    \\u003cquality-gates\\u003e\\n      \\u003cgate\\u003ego test ./...\\u003c/gate\\u003e\\n      \\u003cgate\\u003eCGO_ENABLED=1 go test -race ./...\\u003c/gate\\u003e\\n      \\u003cgate\\u003ego vet ./...\\u003c/gate\\u003e\\n      \\u003cgate\\u003egolangci-lint run\\u003c/gate\\u003e\\n      \\u003cgate\\u003egosec ./... (repo-wide existing findings outside review scope; no new scoped security findings filed)\\u00