e-discovery tool from `glob` to `find`.** The built-in tool\n    34\t  catalog now exposes only `find`; there is no `glob` compatibility alias.\n    35\t  (`agent-1b00b3ea`)\n    36\t\n    37\t## [v0.3.14] — 2026-04-18\n    38\t\n    39\t### Fixed\n    40\t- **Filter SSE comment frames before the `ssestream` decoder.**\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
